UID:69710212c967cb4120832f30@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:A fairy tale adventure about a beautiful young woman and her o
 ne true love. He must find her after a long separation and save her. They 
 must battle the evils of the mythical kingdom of Florin to be reunited wit
 h each other. Based on the William Goldman novel "The Princess Bride" whic
 h earned its own loyal audience.\nRated PG\n1 Hour 38 Minutes
LOCATION:Cedarbrae\, FCCR (First-Floor Auditorium)
