DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260819T193000
UID:6a62126f0e562e28009be502@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join fellow like-minded writers in creative environment! We wi
 ll spend the first 20-30 minutes writing based on a prompt of the libraria
