DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260820T193000
UID:6a693ccec7e02e3d006c51fb@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Every month a group of avid readers meet to discuss the book o
 f the month.  Share your thoughts in an informal\, relaxed and welcoming 
 environment.  This is a fantastic way to meet new friends and learn abou
 t different reader experiences in an informal and welcoming environment. 
  Book of the month is based on TPL's Book Club. Book Club copies are avail
 able at the branch. This month's book is Caste: The Origins of our Discon
 tents by Isobel Wikerson.
