DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260909T150000
UID:6a722f1888e9bf28003572f6@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Please join us for some light refreshments\, and informal disc
 ussion about services in the neighbourhood. Get to know your local library
  staff\, and let us know what information and resources you would like to 
 access at the library and in the community.\nAll adults welcome. Drop in\,
  no registration required.
LOCATION:High Park\, Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a722f1888e9bf28003572f6
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
