DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260808T153000
UID:696a81f51e64afd01e54c27f@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join the Society and Recreation department weekly for a friend
 ly game of chess. Bring your friends and family or meet fellow chess enthu
 siasts to socialize and improve your chess skills.\nChess sets are provide
 d onsite. Players of all levels are welcome. For adults and seniors only. 
 There is not any instructional component to this program.\nDrop-in program
 \, no registration required.\nAll programs in Room 1 from 2 PM to 3:30 PM 
 except:\nFeb. 7\, 2026 eLearning Lab 10:30 AM to 12 PM\nFeb. 21\, 2026 Roo
 m 101\nMay 23\, 2026 eLearning Lab
LOCATION:North York Central Library\, Room 1 (see details)
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/696a81f51e64afd01e54c27f
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
