DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260925T153000
UID:69de6e771e64afd01e692072@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Learn how to do market research for your business plan using t
 he various databases available to you\, for free\, with your Toronto Publi
 c Library card.\nTopics covered include competitor research\, industry rep
 orts\, industry trends\, and customer demographics.\nInformation Collectio
 n Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected by the Toron
 to Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\
 , and 20(d). The information will only be used for event and program regis
 tration\, delivery and evaluation. Questions about how the library handles
  your information can be directed to Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.c
 a\n\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:Toronto Reference Library\, Learning Centre 1
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69de6e771e64afd01e692072
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Ukulele with Meghan
