DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260902T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260902T193000
UID:6a5935d4f213992f00c4c8e6@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Target Audience: Newcomer Entrepreneurs aged 18-39 years old\n
 This program with\nFuturpreneur Canada\ndefines the roadmap on how to writ
 e a business plan. Plan smart\, grow strong. Your blueprint for a successf
 ul business starts here! Designed for those establishing roots\, this blue
 print offers essential steps to start or grow a successful business in Can
 ada.
LOCATION:North York Central Library\, Room 101
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a5935d4f213992f00c4c8e6
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
