BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:DIY Nights: Craft and Socials
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261023T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261023T190000
UID:6963eb2ac967cb4120814849@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Looking for a fun\, low stress way to try new crafts and meet 
 fellow makers? Join us for DIY Night: Craft & Socials\, a monthly adult cr
 afting program featuring a new project each month. Learn something new\, w
 ork at your own pace\, and enjoy casual conversation in a welcoming space.
  Materials are provided\, and beginners are always welcome.\nRegistration 
 is required due to limited supply. However drop in on the day of is welcom
 ed for vacant spots.\nTime: Fourth Friday of each month from 5-7\nUpcoming
  Events:\nAugust 28: Perler Beads\nPerler beads are small plastic cylinder
 s arranged on a grid to create pixel-style designs\, offering adults a rel
 axing\, nostalgic way to craft unique pixel art and custom coasters by fus
 ing them together with an iron.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe perso
 nal information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library un
 der the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The inf
 ormation will only be used for event and program registration\, delivery a
 nd evaluation. Questions about how the library handles your information ca
 n be directed to Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5981\,
  789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:Sanderson\, Program Room on Main Floor
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6963eb2ac967cb4120814849
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
