DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260925T120000
UID:6a61473f1bbbb30f3e80e67c@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:When you join our Citizenship Education Circle\, you will take
  part in four sessions to learn the topics like Canadian history\, geogra
 phy and government\, as well as citizenship rights and responsibilities. 
 During the program\, you will also use and work through the “Discover C
 anada” guide\, a Government of Canada document designed to teach you wha
 t you need to know to become a citizen. This is a free workshop in Englis
 h and Mandarin.
