 k of the month.\nThis book club has relocated to Main Street Branch during
  Dawes Road Branch's closure. New club members are welcome. Each month's s
 election will be available after the previous month's meeting.\nAugust 10 
 :\nThe Museum of Extraordinary Things\nby Alice Hoffman\nSeptember 14 :\nD
 o Not Say We Have Nothing\nby Madeleine Thien\nOctober 5 :\nSuch A Fun Age
 \nby Kiley Reid\nFor adults.\nRegistration is required. Please register in
 -person or by calling 416-393-7700.
