BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:2SLGBTQ+ Book Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260923T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260923T193000
UID:69446bd62c65973d001356ba@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us on the last Wednesday of every month for a warm and li
 vely discussion of 2SLGBTQ+ books! This year we will be reading:\nJanuary\
 n: Biography of X - Catherine Lacey\nFebruary\n: Angry Queer Somali Boy - 
 Mohamed Abdulkarim Ali\nMarch\n: Firebugs - Nino Bulling\nApril\n: Rainbow
  Black - Maggie Thrash\nMay\n: Sorrowland - Rivers Solomon\nJune\n: Stag
  Dance - Torrey Peters\nJuly\n: Peaces - Helen Oyeyemi\nAugust\n: Afterpa
 rties: Stories - Anthony Veasna So\nSeptember\n: To the Moon and Back by 
 Eliana Ramage\nOctober\n: The Loves of My Life: A Sex Memoir by Edmund Wh
 ite\nNovember\n: Loveless - Alice Oseman\nPlease note that the book list 
 is subject to change.\nDrop in. No registration required.
LOCATION:Parkdale\, Auditorium
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69446bd62c65973d001356ba
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
