DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260821T160000
UID:6a66440e7b79214226ab635d@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a matinee screening of\nCharade\n(1963)\, starring
  Audrey Hepburn and Cary Grant.\nIn this Hitchcock-esque thriller that ble
 nds mystery\, comedy\, and romance\, a trio of crooks relentlessly pursues
  a young American through Paris for the fortune her dead husband stole fro
 m them.\nRuntime: 1 hour and 53 minutes.\nDrop-in\, no registration requir
 ed.
LOCATION:Forest Hill\, Program Room
