BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:*CANCELLED*NatureTO: Managing Invasive Plants Around Your Home:
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260806T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260806T200000
UID:69ac42dc8089f23c67606e33@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:*This event has been cancelled*\nJoin City of Toronto Urban Fo
 restry staff for a presentation on invasive plants commonly found around h
 omes in Toronto. Learn how to identify these species\, understand their im
 pact\, and how to manage them. You’ll also get tips on supporting local 
 biodiversity through enhancing native habitats. Perfect for gardeners\, ho
 meowners\, and anyone interested in urban ecology.\nThis program is part o
 f TPL's\nOur Fragile Planet\nprogram series\, supported by Friends of Toro
 nto Public Library\, South Chapter.​\nNo registration. Drop-in.
LOCATION:Yorkville
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69ac42dc8089f23c67606e33
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
