DESCRIPTION:Join our English Conversation Circle\, a friendly space where 
 newcomers can practice speaking English and build confidence. It is open t
 o beginner and intermediate learners\, and we focus on everyday conversati
 ons\, useful vocabulary\, and simple activities. It’s a great way to mee
 t new people and feel more connected to your community.\nNote: This is not
  a formal language class. Refreshments will be served.\nIn partnership wit
 h Immigration\, Refugees and Citizenship Canada\, TNO - The Neighbourhood 
 Organization & Toronto Public Library.
