DESCRIPTION:Do you have a small business or idea and want tailored feedbac
 k and support to take it to the next level? Join the\nBusiness Inc.\nProgr
 am to connect with experienced mentors and other entrepreneurs that will h
 elp you grow.\nDuring eight weekly sessions\, entrepreneurs will learn bus
 iness fundamentals\, get clarity on the viability of their business ideas\
 , get feedback and reviews from professional business advisors\, discuss w
 ith and learn from their peers\, and build a foundation for success.\nAn a
 pplication is required to register for this program. For more details on h
 ow to apply click\nhere\n. Deadline to apply is September 23\, 2026.\n*For
  application purposes\, we align with federal guidelines from Statistics C
 anada\, defining newcomers or recent immigrants as individuals who have ar
 rived within the past five years. At the same time\, we warmly welcome any
 one recently arrived to submit an application.\nDonor Recognition:\nThe Bu
 siness Inc. Newcomer Series is generously supported by Scotiabank with su
 pport from Google.org.\nIn partnership with Toronto Business Development C
 entre.
