DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260821T150000
UID:6a6cf645e30fe4845965f49b@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Drop-in for our biweekly feature. This month\, we will be watc
 hing Hoppers (July 3)\, Zootopia 2 (July 17)\, & Toy Story (July 31). Drop
  in. Space is limited.
