DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260831T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260831T160000
UID:6a60ce4ec7e02e3d006add49@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us on the last Monday of every month as we gather to read
  a play aloud together.\nAugust's play:\n7 Stories\nby Morris Panych\nThis
  program requires registration and is full. For more information or to be 
 added to the waitlist please email trlarts@tpl.ca.
LOCATION:Toronto Reference Library\, B1 (basement meeting room)
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a60ce4ec7e02e3d006add49
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
