DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260915T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260915T160000
UID:69b057bfb48451fc3c07e9f7@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Malvern Library's Craft Club runs twice a month on Tuesdays. 
 Basic supplies provided for learners.\nFirst session\n:\nJoin us in the Di
 gital Innovation Hub to make a crafting-related goodie to take home.\nRegi
 stration required.\nRegister in-person while participating in the previous
  month's session two. Any leftover spots are available to reserve online a
