DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260914T193000
UID:6a353f1edcc1022f003a1e5a@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Do you like to crochet\, embroider\, knit\, sew\, or something
  else entirely? If you are looking to chat with some fellow crafters while
  enjoying your favourite hobby\, come join our Crafting Circle! Bring your
  own supplies and a small project. All skill levels welcome.
