BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Don Mills Poetry Circle
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260901T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260901T200000
UID:6a5e3f73a41369ab2c674cea@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Do you write poetry? Want to meet other poets in the community
  in a friendly\, supportive environment to air your work and share feedbac
 k\, encouragement and inspiration? Join a group of local poets from Septem
 ber to December in our Don Mills Poetry Circle program.\nPlease come to ea
 ch session with a printed copy of a poem based on the following prompts:\n
 Tuesday\, September 1 - Autumn\nTuesday\, October 6 - Bliss: What's Your
 s?\nTuesday\, November 3 - Blood\nTuesday\, December 1 - The Holiday Sea
 son\nRegistration is limited at 12 participants.
LOCATION:Don Mills\, Auditorium
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a5e3f73a41369ab2c674cea
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
