DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260824T153000
UID:6a5929fc0ed7b4521ed62468@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Excel Basics III will discuss filtering and sorting tables\, b
 asic PivotTable\, creating and formatting charts\, and mail merge.  Basic 
 keyboarding and mouse skills required.\nIf the above class date does not f
 it for your busy schedule\, you may book an appointment with a librarian o
 n one-on-one basis.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal informat
 ion on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Publ
 ic Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information wil
 l only be used for event and program registration\, delivery and evaluatio
 n. Questions about how the library handles your information can be directe
 d to Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge S
 treet\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:Maria A. Shchuka\, the Learning Centre
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a5929fc0ed7b4521ed62468
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
