DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260806T153000
UID:6a4c17ebe53a160201fa30d5@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:This is an introduction for beginners on how to use Google Map
 s! Learn the basics of Google’s searching tools\, filters\, & images. E
 xplore Google Maps to find addresses & get directions for public transit &
  road travel.\nSome experience using a laptop is required.\nInformation Co
 llection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected by th
 e Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\,
