DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261017T140000
UID:6a72739ae30fe4845966f7a1@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join our English Conversation Circle\, a friendly space where 
 newcomers can practice speaking English and build confidence. It is open t
 o beginner and intermediate learners\, and we focus on everyday conversati
 ons\, useful vocabulary\, and simple activities. It’s a great way to mee
 t new people and feel more connected to your community. To register please
  call: 647-296-6524\nNote: This is not a formal language class. Refreshme
 nts will be served.\nIn partnership with Immigration\, Refugees and Citize
 nship Canada\, TNO - The Neighbourhood Organization & Toronto Public Libr
 ary.
LOCATION:Thorncliffe
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a72739ae30fe4845966f7a1
