 owing you to make informed decisions.\nKnow the basics of what to look fo
 r when searching for a job in Canada.\nLearn how to boost your applicatio
 n with training opportunities and supports available to you.\nTo registe
 r\, contact LSP Program Worker Shane at saquino@culturelink.ca or 416-931-
 6536\nIn partnership with Immigration\, Refugees and Citizenship Canada\, 
 CultureLink Settlement & Community Services & Toronto Public Library
